# analysant-concepts v1
# The seed sense table for the reference project: the five generic words that carried 21 of the spike's
# 37 contradiction pairs across unrelated meanings (spike-report-2026-11-16.md:334-340). Each sense's cues
# are words that co-occur with that meaning in the corpus; the 21 pairs are this table's first negative
# tests (crates/analysant/tests/gate_v8.rs). A cue the context does not contain leaves the word ambiguous,
# and an ambiguous word suppresses nothing.

concept budget
forms: budgets
status: active
sense budget-tolerance | the numerical error a rewrite may spend | cues: tolerance
sense budget-parallelism | how much parallel work the optimizer may use | cues: parallelism
sense budget-device-bytes | the planner's byte budget for a device (PlanOptions) | cues: planoptions, vram
sense budget-consumer-entitlement | the consumer-contract resource budget (C-5) | cues: consumer
sense budget-placement | the memory condition in a placement fallback rule | cues: fallback
evidence: spike-report-2026-11-16.md:334 (11 pairs, one negated side)

concept harvest
forms: harvests, harvesting
status: active
sense harvest-census | a runtime value census of a decode step | cues: census, memoization
sense harvest-pattern | pattern harvesting for rule discovery | cues: pattern
evidence: spike-report-2026-11-16.md:335 (4 pairs)

concept lifecycle
status: active
sense lifecycle-work | the work lifecycle the consumer contract leaves undecided | cues: retry, streaming, handle | excludes: md
sense lifecycle-document | the lifecycle document, cited by a link | cues: md
evidence: spike-report-2026-11-16.md:336 (3 pairs; the positive sides are references)

concept written
status: active
sense written-materialized | a value that is never written to memory | cues: never written
sense written-by-hand | authored by hand | cues: hand
evidence: spike-report-2026-11-16.md:337 (2 pairs)

concept network
forms: networks
status: active
sense network-connectivity | a computer network connection | cues: bundled, offline, package
sense network-neural | a neural network | cues: neural
evidence: spike-report-2026-11-16.md:338 (1 pair)
